@host = http://localhost:5266

### Registrar usuário

POST {{host}}/api/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria",
  "email": "maria@teste.com",
  "senha": "senha1234"
}

### Login

POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@teste.com",
  "senha": "senha1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Criar casamento
POST http://localhost:5266/api/casamento
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomeNoivo1": "Maria",
  "nomeNoivo2": "João",
  "dataPrevista": "2027-06-12",
  "cidade": "Blumenau",
  "orcamentoTotal": 50000
}

### Ver casamento
GET http://localhost:5266/api/casamento
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar categorias
GET http://localhost:5266/api/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar categoria
POST http://localhost:5266/api/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Lua de mel" }

### Editar categoria
PUT http://localhost:5266/api/categorias/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Buffet e bebidas" }

### Excluir categoria
DELETE http://localhost:5266/api/categorias/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar despesa à vista
POST http://localhost:5266/api/despesas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Buffet - entrada",
  "valorTotal": 8000,
  "categoriaId": 3,
  "status": "APagar"
}

### Listar (com filtros opcionais)
GET http://localhost:5266/api/despesas?categoriaId=1&status=APagar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Editar
PUT http://localhost:5266/api/despesas/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Buffet - entrada",
  "valorTotal": 5000,
  "categoriaId": 4,
  "status": "APagar"
}

### Excluir
DELETE http://localhost:5266/api/despesas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Parcelar em 3x
POST http://localhost:5266/api/despesas/4/parcelas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantidade": 3,
  "primeiroVencimento": "2027-01-31"
}

### Ver parcelas
GET http://localhost:5266/api/despesas/4/parcelas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver a despesa
GET http://localhost:5266/api/despesas/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pagar parcela (data de hoje)
POST http://localhost:5266/api/parcelas/7/pagar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pagar parcela com data
POST http://localhost:5266/api/parcelas/30/pagar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dataPagamento": "2027-10-30" }

### Situação do plano
GET http://localhost:5266/api/assinatura
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Assinar
POST http://localhost:5266/api/assinatura/assinar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar
POST http://localhost:5266/api/assinatura/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}